all 的每日发版日志</title><link>https://dev.to/poprecallgames/62-tiny-browser-games-and-counting-pop-recalls-daily-shipping-log-223</link><description>Pop Recall 四天前以 25 款纯原生 JavaScript 微型浏览器游戏上线，如今已涨到 62 款仍在每日更新；每款新游戏都要过同一套发版关卡——能通关、适配手机、暂停真正锁输入，上线后还要实测。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:02:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bb9bea4dc38062e2a06ca03a97e91d08a3a23e97</guid><source url="https://dev.to/poprecallgames/62-tiny-browser-games-and-counting-pop-recalls-daily-shipping-log-223">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用 HTML5 Canvas 与 WebSockets 打造实时多人棋盘游戏引擎：Ludo Classic 架构解析</title><link>https://dev.to/uchitchakma/building-a-real-time-multiplayer-board-game-engine-with-html5-canvas-websockets-the-architecture-10a4</link><description>作者拆解一款实时多人棋盘游戏的引擎架构，讲 Canvas 渲染与 WebSocket 同步如何支撑回合制对局。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:36:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">88e75b91ad9b7b716d17c88b0da6dd320118eb68</guid><source url="https://dev.to/uchitchakma/building-a-real-time-multiplayer-board-game-engine-with-html5-canvas-websockets-the-architecture-10a4">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我做了一个 AI 助手，能用一句话聊天指令改 Unreal Engine 蓝图</title><link>https://dev.to/dola_ai_pro/i-built-an-ai-agent-that-edits-unreal-engine-blueprints-from-a-chat-prompt-3d4d</link><description>独立开发者花一年做的 Dola AI 嵌进 UE5 编辑器里，用自然语言描述需求就能让多智能体改蓝图、写 C++ 并自动试玩验证，文章讲了它怎么工作、还差在哪。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 04:33:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5a368a99abb674e259c4b4bc19b38e53f1d02ea5</guid><source url="https://dev.to/dola_ai_pro/i-built-an-ai-agent-that-edits-unreal-engine-blueprints-from-a-chat-prompt-3d4d">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>独游开发者吐槽：“发行商想要55%收入，还不保证营销费” ，同行：来收租呢？</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606580</link><description>五名芬兰学生开发的弹球 Roguelike 收到的首份发行报价要拿走 55% 收入且不保证营销投入，引发同行对发行分成是否合理的讨论。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:07:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">42e79b06e54b907242eccd909cd5629c2eb2bd69</guid>